# Environment config for this repo:
#
# Secrets + env overrides → app/config.py (Settings)
# Domain constants        → app/integrations/*/constants.py, app/server/constants.py
# Verbose logging (dev)   → APP_ENV=dev (see docker-compose-dev.yml)
# Local secrets           → cp .env.dev.example .env.dev
# Dev overrides           → docker-compose-dev.yml
# HKU testing/prod        → GEAR sidecar + Infisical (see .env.prod)
